{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38116","headline":"隰州新驿 · 韩偓","name":"隰州新驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛德已图形，胡爲忽构兵。\n燎原虽自及，诛乱不无名。\n掷鼠须防误，连鸡莫惮惊。\n本期将系虏，末策但婴城。\n肘腋人情变，朝廷物论生。\n果闻荒谷缢，旋覩藁街烹。\n帝怒今方息，时危喜暂清。\n始终俱以此，天意甚分明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}